      "date": "2026-05-28T12:24:00.000Z",
      "title": "Ekennis Software Service Limited Announces Resignation of Urvashi Upadhya from Independent Director, Effective June 27, 2026",
      "body": "Ekennis Software Service Limited informed that Ms. Urvashi Upadhya (DIN: 09366633) tendered her resignation as Independent Director of the Company with effect from June 27, 2026. The resignation was due to personal commitments and health-related concerns. Ms. Urvashi Upadhya confirmed that there are no other material reasons for her resignation apart from the personal commitments and health issues mentioned in her resignation letter dated May 28, 2026. The Company was requested to take necessary steps to remove her name from the records of the Board of Directors and arrange for filing of the requisite forms and compliances with the Registrar of Companies (ROC) in accordance with the provisions of the Companies Act, 2013.",
